Package: qore-v8-app-catalogue
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, qore-v8-module (>= 2.1.0~git20260930.1), nodejs (>= 22.13)
Description: optional application catalogue for the Qore TypeScript interface
 This package provides the compiled TypeScript application catalogue and its
 private JavaScript dependencies for integrations with external service APIs.
 Applications require their own service credentials and access permissions.
